{"desc":"Opus 4.7 是 Anthropic Opus 系列的下一代产品，专为长时间运行的异步代理而设计。它在 Opus 4.6 的编码和代理功能优势基础上，显著提升了复杂多步骤任务的性能，并在扩展工作流中实现了更可靠的代理执行。对于任务随时间展开的异步代理流水线（例如大型代码库、多阶段调试和端到端项目编排），Opus 4.7 尤为有效。\n\n除了编码之外，Opus 4.7 还增强了知识工作能力，涵盖文档撰写、演示文稿制作以及数据分析等各个方面。它能够在超长的输出和长时间会话中保持一致性，使其成为需要坚持、判断和执行的任务的理想选择。\n\n对于从早期 Opus 版本升级的用户，请参阅我们的[官方迁移指南](https://openrouter.ai/docs/guides/evaluate-and-optimize/model-migrations/claude-4-7)。","rows":[{"slug":"cun","name":"CUN.AI","usd":true,"cnDown":true,"href":"https://www.cun.ai/","logo":"https://wintoken-files.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/promotions/20260630230910_25824431aca9306f.png","main":{"name":"default","in":75,"out":375,"cache":null,"avail":100,"latencyMs":3630,"points":[[1792580400,100],[1792584000,100],[1792587600,100],[1792591200,100],[1792594800,100],[1792598400,100],[1792602000,100],[1792605600,100],[1792609200,100],[1792612800,100],[1792616400,100],[1792620000,100],[1792623600,100],[1792627200,100],[1792630800,100],[1792634400,100],[1792638000,100],[1792641600,100],[1792645200,100],[1792648800,100],[1792652400,100],[1792656000,100],[1792659600,100],[1792663200,-1]]},"others":[]},{"slug":"lmyanyu","name":"LuMingAPI","usd":false,"cnDown":false,"href":"https://lmyanyu.com/register","logo":"","main":{"name":"claude-kiro 正价 缓存95","in":null,"out":null,"cache":null,"avail":95.65217391304348,"latencyMs":2809,"points":[[1792580400,100],[1792584000,100],[1792587600,100],[1792591200,100],[1792594800,100],[1792598400,100],[1792602000,100],[1792605600,100],[1792609200,0],[1792612800,100],[1792616400,100],[1792620000,100],[1792623600,100],[1792627200,100],[1792630800,100],[1792634400,100],[1792638000,100],[1792641600,100],[1792645200,100],[1792648800,100],[1792652400,100],[1792656000,100],[1792659600,100],[1792663200,-1]]},"others":[]},{"slug":"lingsuan","name":"灵算","usd":false,"cnDown":true,"href":"https://lingsuan.top/register?invite_code=2NF799KR","logo":"","main":{"name":"cc-max-满血","in":null,"out":null,"cache":null,"avail":95.65217391304348